    "body": "## D 代理交接（2026-11-04）\n\nPR #236 already implements ScoringMapping step 1. Do not create a duplicate step-1 branch/PR. It currently conflicts with main after #227, so coordinate the rebase/merge after #237 is settled. Before merging #236, change its `Closes #224` wording to a partial-step reference: issue #224 must remain open while steps 2–4 are outstanding.\n\nAfter step 1 lands, D takes step 2 (validate each item’s `weight_share` sum and report >1.0), then separately plan step 3 (`score_rules` consumed by the scorer) and step 4 (scoring changes invalidate prior review). Keep each step independently tested and linked here.",
